### Claude Code / AI tooling ###
# Per-user overrides and local state stay out of git.
# Team-shared config lives in .claude/{settings.json,hooks,agents,skills} and IS committed.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/state/
.claude/cache/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.cursor/
.ai-cache/

### spoke-parity-checker working caches (per ADR-0036) ###
# The subagent writes screenshots + XML dumps to /tmp/ during D4 runs.
# These paths catch any defensive in-repo copy that scripts might create
# accidentally. The real working dir is /tmp/ which is OS-level and never tracked.
**/spoke-inspection/
**/rotpro-inspection/
apps/mobile/integration_test/.spoke-cache/
# Hierarchy dumps + screenshots from inventory/audit work — empirical evidence
# stays in /tmp/spoke-inspection/ only; in-repo `docs/inventory/dumps/` blocked
# to prevent accidental commit of 19k+ line JSON dumps or screenshots violating
# the ADR-0010 legal boundary (no asset extraction).
docs/inventory/dumps/

### Maestro MCP working caches (per ADR-0037) ###
# Maestro CLI writes session state, screenshots, and recording artifacts.
# Inventory dumps go to /tmp/spoke-inspection/ (already covered above);
# this entry catches any in-repo cache the MCP server might emit.
**/maestro-cache/
.maestro/
